A guard spots me immediately and the chase is on.

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:35,700
That was way too close -- I almost lost it right there.

5
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:42,300
And... caught. That attempt is over.

6
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:50,300
Time to change the plan before I try again.

7
